2022 New tooltip: a friendly reminder to pick your playing mode before starting the game, because we've got you covered.", "created_date": 1786360122, "id": "37541234325522489", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 49, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}